  "confidence": "high",
  "narrative": "Recent data imply a persistently high death pace through February 2026, with risks weighted toward a total above 900 by end-March or end-April. While there is uncertainty from weather, SAR capacity, and policy responses, the balance of evidence supports a high likelihood of exceeding 900 within the forecast window, yielding a 96% posterior estimate.",
